  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/pacific/2026/10/15/china-fiji-zhao-fugang-influence-corruption/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国指控斐济前官员为中国贪腐后，专家警告中国在南太平洋地区影响力网络</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">After US accuses Fijian of corruption for China, experts warn of region-wide network</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国此前指控斐济一名前高级官员为中国公司贪腐，引发专家警示中国在南太平洋岛国地区可能存在的广泛影响力网络，该事件凸显了地缘政治竞争下的透明度与反腐挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/15/china-has-captured-the-market-for-hobbyist-3d-printers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国已主导业余3D打印机市场</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China has captured the market for hobbyist 3D printers</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国制造商已在全球业余爱好者3D打印机市场中占据主导地位，凭借其成本效益和技术进步，显著改变了个人和小型企业的制造格局，反映了中国在全球消费电子领域的强大竞争力。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3371067/visas-china-approval-direct-outcome-trump-xi-summit-beijing-says?utm_source=rss_feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">北京称Visa获准进入中国市场是特朗普与习近平峰会的“直接成果”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Visa’s China approval a ‘direct outcome’ of Trump-Xi summit, Beijing says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">北京方面表示，Visa获准在中国开展银行卡清算业务，是中美两国元首特朗普与习近平此前峰会的直接成果。这标志着中国金融市场进一步对外开放，也体现了高层外交对经贸合作的推动作用。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/16/2003866047\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台积电考虑在美国得克萨斯州增设工厂</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">TSMC eyes adding facilities in Texas</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">全球领先的半导体制造商台积电正考虑在美国得克萨斯州增设芯片制造设施。此举是其在美国亚利桑那州现有投资的拓展，旨在加强全球供应链韧性并响应美国本土化生产的需求。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1exgw3j115o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中朝新界河大桥拖延12年后终开通</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">North Korea and China open new bridge after 12-year delay</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">历经12年的拖延，连接中国与朝鲜的新鸭绿江界河大桥正式开通。这座大桥有望加强两国间的贸易和交通联系，对于朝鲜半岛的区域经济发展具有潜在影响，同时也反映了中朝关系的复杂性。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/15/lebanon-hezbollah-explosives-israel-rubio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">鲁比奥敦促黎巴嫩抵制真主党在扣押爆炸物问题上的压力</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Rubio urges Lebanon to resist Hezbollah pressure over seized explosives</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国参议员马可·鲁比奥呼吁黎巴嫩政府抵制真主党在处理一批被扣押爆炸物问题上的压力。该事件涉及国家主权与安全，凸显了黎巴嫩内政中的地缘政治复杂性和派系斗争。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/15/nx-s1-5996678/midlife-wall-re